    "original_ingredient_text": "Key Ingredients Bakuchiol · Volufiline · Collagen · Barrier Support Non-GreasyDewy FinishDaily CreamBarrier Support Key Ingredients: Bakuchiol, Volufiline, Hydrolyzed Collagen, Snail Secretion Filtrate, EGF peptide, Hyaluronic Acid, Ceramide, Panthenol and Cica. Benefits: Firm-looking skin, plumping care, dewy hydration, barrier support and smooth texture. Texture: Silky, lightweight cream that absorbs comfortably without a greasy finish. Refer to the product packaging for the complete and most current ingredient list. For external use only. Avoid direct contact with the eyes. Perform a patch test before first use. Discontinue use if persistent irritation occurs. Keep out of reach of children.",
